ities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"深澤縣，前漢屬涿郡，後漢屬安平，晉以來屬博陵郡。後魏博陵郡屬定州。唐以博陵郡爲定州，後分定州置祁州，深澤縣屬焉。","note_content_jianti_auto":"深泽县，前汉属涿郡，后汉属安平，晋以来属博陵郡。后魏博陵郡属定州。唐以博陵郡为定州，后分定州置祁州，深泽县属焉。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"a9145844-db0e-11ef-9222-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"魏字衍。","note_content_jianti_auto":"魏字衍。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"a9145857-db0e-11ef-bc93-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"定州","place_name_jianti_auto":"定州","resolved_place_entity_id":319,"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"a914585d-db0e-11ef-b5e2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"18魏定州刺史高陽許宗之求取不節，深澤民馬超謗毀宗之，宗之毆殺超，恐其家人告狀，上超詆訕朝政。魏高宗曰：「此必妄也。朕爲天下主，何惡於超而有此言！必宗之懼罪誣超。」案驗，果然。斬宗之於都南。","content_fanyi":"北魏定州刺史高阳人许宗之索取财物没有节制，深泽百姓马超公开指责许宗之，许宗之将马超打死，因担心他的家人告发，便上奏朝廷，称马超诽谤朝政。北魏高宗拓跋濬说：“这一定是凭空捏造。朕为天下之主，哪里得罪过马超，竟让他说出这种话！一定是许宗之畏罪诬陷马超。”经查证，果然如此。于是将许宗之在都城南郊斩首。","content_jianti_auto":"18魏定州刺史高阳许宗之求取不节，深泽民马超谤毁宗之，宗之殴杀超，恐其家人告状，上超诋讪朝政。魏高宗曰：「此必妄也。朕为天下主，何恶于超而有此言！必宗之惧罪诬超。」案验，果然。斩宗之于都南。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":11941,"number":18,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百二十八 (宋紀十) / 世祖孝武皇帝上 / 三年 / 第 18 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"a9145843-db0e-11ef-95f2-a0d3651f611f","year_int":456},"tongjian_id":"a9145843-db0e-11ef-95f2-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":8},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"定州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"定州","place_name_jianti_auto":"定州","resolved_place_entity_id":319,"start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"aa36767c-db0e-11ef-b7ff-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"13十一月，戊子，魏以太尉、安樂王長樂爲定州刺史，司空李訢爲徐州刺史。","content_fanyi":"十一月初三日戊子，北魏委任太尉、安乐王拓跋长乐为定州刺史，司空李訢为徐州刺史。","content_jianti_auto":"13十一月，戊子，魏以太尉、安乐王长乐为定州刺史，司空李䜣为徐州刺史。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":12570,"number":13,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百三十四 (宋紀十六) / 蒼梧王下 / 元徽四年 / 第 21 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"aa367676-db0e-11ef-a378-a0d3651f611f","year_int":476},"tongjian_id":"aa367676-db0e-11ef-a378-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":9},{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"定州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":13,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"見一百三十七卷世祖永明八年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"aad7bc52-db0e-11ef-9587-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"世祖","people_name_jianti_auto":"世祖","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"ac09448a-db0e-11ef-808d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"見一百三十七卷世祖永明八年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"见一百三十七卷世祖永明八年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"ac094489-db0e-11ef-bc75-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"張","people_name_jianti_auto":"张","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"ac09448e-db0e-11ef-8c5b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『張：「溫」作「濕」。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『张：「温」作「湿」。』","note_type":"『張：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"ac09448d-db0e-11ef-b807-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"ac09448c-db0e-11ef-baab-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"爲，于僞翻；下強爲同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"为，于伪翻；下强为同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":101,"tongjian_id":"ac09448f-db0e-11ef-832e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"汝陰王","people_name_jianti_auto":"汝阴王","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"ac094491-db0e-11ef-ae49-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"天賜","people_name_jianti_auto":"天赐","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"ac094492-db0e-11ef-8b9b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景穆太子","people_name_jianti_auto":"景穆太子","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"ac094493-db0e-11ef-b938-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"ac094494-db0e-11ef-aa6d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"汝陰王天賜，景穆太子之子，於魏主爲叔祖。樂，音洛。將，卽亮翻。驍，堅堯翻。騎，奇寄翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汝阴王天赐，景穆太子之子，于魏主为叔祖。乐，音洛。将，即亮翻。骁，坚尧翻。骑，奇寄翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":170,"tongjian_id":"ac094490-db0e-11ef-9516-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"楚子","people_name_jianti_auto":"楚子","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"ac094496-db0e-11ef-918b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"定王","people_name_jianti_auto":"定王","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"ac094497-db0e-11ef-9e27-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"王孫滿","people_name_jianti_auto":"王孙满","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"ac094498-db0e-11ef-aa4d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"楚子","people_name_jianti_auto":"楚子","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"ac094499-db0e-11ef-a0ec-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"楚子","people_name_jianti_auto":"楚子","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"ac09449a-db0e-11ef-b060-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"王孫滿","people_name_jianti_auto":"王孙满","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"ac09449b-db0e-11ef-8d7f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"陸渾之戎","place_name_jianti_auto":"陆浑之戎","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"ac09449c-db0e-11ef-8581-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"洛","place_name_jianti_auto":"洛","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"ac09449d-db0e-11ef-b7a6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"ac09449e-db0e-11ef-af0e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":83,"tongjian_id":"ac09449f-db0e-11ef-b14d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"左傳：楚子伐陸渾之戎，遂至于洛，觀兵于周疆。定王使王孫滿勞楚子；楚子問鼎之大小、輕重焉。王孫滿曰：「德之休明，雖小，重也；其姦回昏亂，雖大，輕也。天祚明德，有所底止。周德雖衰，天命未改，鼎之輕重，未可問也。」","note_content_jianti_auto":"左传：楚子伐陆浑之戎，遂至于洛，观兵于周疆。定王使王孙满劳楚子；楚子问鼎之大小、轻重焉。王孙满曰：「德之休明，虽小，重也；其奸回昏乱，虽大，轻也。天祚明德，有所底止。周德虽衰，天命未改，鼎之轻重，未可问也。」","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":194,"tongjian_id":"ac094495-db0e-11ef-b3ea-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"定州","place_name_jianti_auto":"定州","resolved_place_entity_id":319,"start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"ac0944a9-db0e-11ef-8a0f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"定州","place_name_jianti_auto":"定州","resolved_place_entity_id":319,"start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"ac0944ae-db0e-11ef-9304-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/八、大同府（卷四十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"隋为恒安镇。开皇十九年，遣代州总管韩洪镇恒安，为突厥达头...","context_before":"...，西至河，南至中山隘门寨，北至五原，地方千里，以为甸服。","source_end_index":349,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"c76d2aed-af9d-5be7-950a-75be749d38e4","source_start_index":328,"source_text":"孝文都洛，改置恒州，及六镇之乱，故都为墟。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/八、大同府（卷四十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"22初，魏文明太后欲廢魏主，穆泰切諫而止，由是有寵。及帝南遷洛陽，所親任者多中州儒士，宗室及代人往往不樂。泰自尚書右僕射出爲定州刺史，自陳久病，土溫則甚，乞爲恆州；帝爲之徙恆州刺史陸叡爲定州，以泰代之。泰至，叡未發，遂相與謀作亂，陰結鎭北大將軍樂陵王思譽、安樂侯隆、撫冥鎭將魯郡侯業、驍騎將軍超等，共推朔州刺史陽平王頤爲主。思譽，天賜之子；業，丕之弟；隆、超，皆丕之子也。叡以爲洛陽休明，勸泰緩之，泰由是未發。","content_fanyi":"当初，北魏文明太后想要废黜孝文帝，穆泰极力劝谏才作罢，因此受到宠信。等到孝文帝南迁洛阳，亲近信任的大多是中州儒士，宗室成员和代京旧人往往心怀不满。穆泰由尚书右仆射出任定州刺史，却不愿上任，自称久病，到了气候温暖湿润的地方病情就会加重，请求改任恒州；孝文帝为此将恒州刺史陆叡调任定州，让穆泰接替恒州。穆泰到任后，陆叡还没有出发，二人便共同密谋作乱，暗中联络镇北大将军乐陵王元思誉、安乐侯元隆、抚冥镇将鲁郡侯元业、骁骑将军元超等人，一起推举朔州刺史阳平王元颐为主。元思誉是元天赐之子，元业是元丕之弟，元隆、元超都是元丕之子。陆叡认为洛阳政治清明，劝穆泰暂缓行动，穆泰因此没有起兵。","content_jianti_auto":"22初，魏文明太后欲废魏主，穆泰切谏而止，由是有宠。及帝南迁洛阳，所亲任者多中州儒士，宗室及代人往往不乐。泰自尚书右仆射出为定州刺史，自陈久病，土温则甚，乞为恒州；帝为之徙恒州刺史陆叡为定州，以泰代之。泰至，叡未发，遂相与谋作乱，阴结镇北大将军乐陵王思誉、安乐侯隆、抚冥镇将鲁郡侯业、骁骑将军超等，共推朔州刺史阳平王颐为主。思誉，天赐之子；业，丕之弟；隆、超，皆丕之子也。叡以为洛阳休明，劝泰缓之，泰由是未发。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":13337,"number":22,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百四十 (齊紀六) / 高宗明皇帝中 / 三年 / 第 29 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"ac094488-db0e-11ef-a3e9-a0d3651f611f","year_int":496},"tongjian_id":"ac094488-db0e-11ef-a3e9-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":10}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":12,"total_paragraphs":114},"place_name":"定州"},"message":"success","success":true}